# CosDifference: real difference-angle identity.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/cos_difference.lit
# Previously rejected, exact legacy-positive source:
# forall x,y R:
#     cos(x-y) = cos(x)*cos(y)+sin(x)*sin(y)
forall x,y R:
    cos(x-y) = cos(x)*cos(y)+sin(x)*sin(y)
# Boundary: the subtraction formula fails in Rust regressions.
